  "body": "## Summary\n- Validate release-candidate purpose and actual tested checkout T in the mandatory common policy, independently of protected-B lightweight admission.\n- Verify selected release source S/package/size before public mutations using the immutable workflow helper and exact same-release-run/producer-attempt report.\n- Preserve native draft \u2192 upload \u2192 complete remote readback \u2192 native publication \u2192 crate publication, current authorization/provenance/recovery/finalization, and ordinary version-reader compatibility.\n\n## Authority\n[COD-110](https://linear.app/codebasegraph/issue/COD-110), C103-R07/A07 and R08/A08, retained R04\u2013R06/A04\u2013A06. Five canonical contracts at approved full SHA `316be4c4bb81d4f6e025016b12374836b4dcc1a8`, [spec](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/316be4c4bb81d4f6e025016b12374836b4dcc1a8/docs/specs/COD-103/spec.md)/Design9 and linked contracts; [separate approval](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/0e6008a1f46679a86aba85ac513beb05af94b0c0/docs/specs/COD-103/approvals/2026-10-31-revision-0.3.md). [Compatibility decision](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/49612ec66814ad6b883a0c4c3c624911bd5a8825/docs/specs/COD-103/decisions/2026-11-01-cod110-compatibility.md)/[separate approval](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/754c82f4dc22c203c22a433f5bbae5f2f6e80231/docs/specs/COD-103/approvals/2026-11-01-cod110-compatibility.md), user decision2917ddb7. Scryer node-1 DESIGN/EXECUTION, chg-wzt5hk unchanged. [Engineer accepted local evidence/final review and authorized this delivery](https://linear.app/codebasegraph/issue/COD-110#comment-aa03cd75-7f80-4ca3-83fd-bc33daa6f2db).\n\n## Reviewed/tested snapshot and evidence\nHead `862bb3b3c40c36b21cdcd388f596d52ad482530b` / tree `02cd3ebed5a1861bef4506f678449d836e7e2bf8`. Exact7implementation blobs match accepted dirty-source hashes in [source identity](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/862bb3b3c40c36b21cdcd388f596d52ad482530b/docs/specs/COD-103/evidence/COD-110/2026-11-02-local-qualification-154/source-identity.json); evidence is faithfully versioned without rewriting original paths/revisions.\n\n- Independent full xtask154/154PASS, no failures/errors/skips/not-run; fmtPASS; strictworkspace all-targets/all-features ClippyPASS, zero warnings; actual check-workflows and ordinary release-gatePASS. Genuine JUnit `3989e689fa6fbc56d39ca83492da5f7fbb59151fc81113508d4609c0afb5aa67`, UUIDcc347ab0-542a-451e-96dd-5279125bbdbf.\n- Fresh independent FinalReview PASS/no confirmedP0\u2013P3/no fix obligation. Requested/accepted `openai-codex/gpt-6.1-sol`, MAX, nativeRLMfresh/default/nonfork/adversarial; runtime selfmetadata unexposed, no providerfallback. [Review](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/862bb3b3c40c36b21cdcd388f596d52ad482530b/docs/specs/COD-103/evidence/COD-110/2026-11-02-local-qualification-154/final-review/report.md) and exact host receipt alongside.\n- [Evidence index/criteria/limits](https://github.com/rabii-chaarani/codebaseGraph/blob/862bb3b3c40c36b21cdcd388f596d52ad482530b/docs/specs/COD-103/evidence/COD-110/2026-11-02-local-qualification-154/index.md). Current final18 and unchanged sharedcore114 preserved; historical failed format/test/lint attempts, original40/current40 and source-result preservation incidents remain distinct\u2014not relabelled currentPASS. Core nested.git39 payloads carried safely in plainTAR115regularmembers including originalmanifest, allmemberhash/size/mode readbackverified; adjacentkeyfiles are explicit byte-identical duplicatecarriers.\n\n## Hosted and remaining gates\nThis is the approved true stack child `cod103-stack/cod-110` \u2192 `cod103-stack/cod-108` at accepted predecessor9ae63. Its own FULL child CI/required qualification is now due and will be reported for the exact head/base/integration source; localPASS/review does not replace it. No PR product-archive retention is promised outside existing policy. Two supported native targets remain macos-arm64/windows-x86_64.\n\nNo main merge or release action in this handoff. Protected-main trusted-lightweight/common-policy and mixed/untrusted-full rollout must refresh after COD110. Serial integration requires currentbase/fullCI, authorized non-bypass strict freshness and own fullmainCI; full approved queue/contents, platform/publication qualification and independent public verification/aggregateowners remain. Closed local doubles are not live registry/package/publication qualification. No settings/permissions/dependencies/targets/endpoint changes.\n",
